<title>SINGAPORE: Times Publishing sees better second half.</title>
<headline>Times Publishing sees better second half.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Publishing Ltd said on Wednesday it expected its operating results in the second half of its financial year to be better than in the first half.</p>
<p>The company made the forecast in a statement issued with its results for the six months to February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>The company reported a 58.9 percent year-on-year rise in net profit to Singapore $12.6 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
